{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "c3d4e5f6-a7b8-9012-cdef-123456789012",
    "name": "Baby Go — Provider Products",
    "description": "Productos del provider. Bearer JWT. Store 1:1 (no mandar storeId).\n\n**List:** GET /v1/products?page=1&limit=20&status=&category= → `{ items, page, limit, total, totalPages }` (default page=1, limit=20, máx 100).\n**Create:** `{ category, title, description, price, attributes? }` → draft. `title` único → `title_not_available`.\n**PATCH /:id** parcial: title, description, category, price (merge; offer:null quita oferta), attributes (merge; null borra key), status.\n**DELETE /:id** borra producto + todas las medias del bucket; lo saca de bundles (borra bundles con <2 productos).\n**Medias:** POST /:id/medias form-data field `media` (File). Máx 8 / 5MB. Respuesta `{ id, url, width, height, format, bytes, urls: { original, thumbnail, card, detail } }`.\n**DELETE media** también borra del bucket.\n**Save:** POST /:id/save → active. Completitud: title, description, category, price.list>0, attributes, ≥1 foto. 400 `product_incomplete` + `missing[]`.\n\nVariables: token, productId, mediaId.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      {
        "key": "token",
        "value": "{{token}}",
        "type": "string"
      }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "baseUrl",
      "value": "http://localhost:3000/api"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "productId",
      "value": ""
    },
    {
      "key": "mediaId",
      "value": ""
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "0. Ver mis productos",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar mis productos",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/products",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "products"
              ],
              "query": [
                {
                  "key": "status",
                  "value": "draft",
                  "disabled": true,
                  "description": "draft | active | inactive"
                },
                {
                  "key": "category",
                  "value": "bike",
                  "disabled": true
                },
                {
                  "key": "page",
                  "value": "1",
                  "description": "Página (default 1)"
                },
                {
                  "key": "limit",
                  "value": "20",
                  "description": "Items por página (default 20, máx 100)"
                }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lista paginada de productos de la store del token. Query: status, category, page, limit. Respuesta `{ items, page, limit, total, totalPages }`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Obtener un producto",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/v1/products/{{productId}}",
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "v1",
                "products",
                "{{productId}}"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Detalle de un producto propio. 404 si no existe o no es del provider."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
